abstract: >-
  The quantum-simulation realization backend of PANINI. A Kuramoto oscillator substrate, the
  PEDLER automaton on it, a Qiskit continuous-time quantum walk validator, Max-Cut benchmarks
  and a mocked hardware bridge, with what is tested, mocked and open stated plainly.
